 I switch word book or unit?","打开「词库中心」选择词书和单元，首页的学习路径会同步切换。词库按启蒙、小学、初中、高中，以及考试、场景、职场分类。","Open the library and pick a book and unit; the home path follows. Books are grouped into starter, primary, junior, senior, exams, scenes and work."],["体力用完了怎么办？","What if I run out of hearts?","体力满格 5 点，课程里每答错一题扣 1 点（单元测验和错题练习不扣）。用完后每 4 小时自动恢复 1 点；也可以去「错题复习」练习，每答对 1 题补回 1 点；或花 350 宝石立即补满。","You have up to 5 hearts; each wrong answer in a lesson costs 1 (unit tests and mistake practice don’t). One heart refills every 4 hours; each correct answer in Review practice earns one back; or refill instantly for 350 gems."],["宝石怎么获得，能用来做什么？","How do I earn and spend gems?","完成每日任务后领取，每项 10 宝石；打开单元宝箱得 30–50 宝石；联赛周榜第 1、2、3 名分别得 50、30、20 宝石。宝石可以在「宝石商店」补满体力（350）、买连胜保护（200，最多存 2 个）或双倍经验 15 分钟（300）。","Claim 10 gems for each daily quest you finish, 30–50 from a unit chest, and 50 / 30 / 20 for 1st / 2nd / 3rd in the weekly league. Spend them in the gem shop: refill hearts (350), a streak freeze (200, hold up to 2) or 15 minutes of double XP (300)."],["连胜天数怎么算？断了还能补回来吗？","How does the streak work? Can I repair it?","每天完成 1 节课，或获得的经验达到每日目标的三分之一（至少 10 XP），就算学习了一天。漏学一天时，如果你有连胜保护会自动用掉 1 个保住连胜；没有的话，下次打开时可以花 400 宝石修复，或者从头开始。","Finish one lesson, or earn a third of your daily goal (at least 10 XP), to count the day. If you miss a day, a streak freeze is used automatically; without one, you can repair the streak for 400 gems the next time you open the app, or start over."],["错题本里的题什么时候会消失？","When do items leave my mistakes list?","答错的单词和句子会进入错题本。在「错题复习」里答对一次就会移出；在平时练习里多次答对、记忆等级升高后也会自动移出。","Words and sentences you miss go into your mistakes. Answer one correctly in Review and it leaves the list; it also leaves once you’ve got it right enough times in other practice."],["复习是怎么安排的？","How are reviews scheduled?","按记忆曲线：答对的词会隔 1、2、4、7、15、30、60 天再出现；答错的词会降低记忆等级，当天再来。首页和「错题复习」会提示今天该复习的数量。","Spaced repetition: correct words come back after 1, 2, 4, 7, 15, 30 and 60 days; missed words drop a level and return the same day. Home and Review show how many are due today."],["联赛是怎么分组和结算的？","How do leagues work?","联赛是单机模拟的：每周一你会和 29 位模拟对手（不是真人）分在一组，按本周获得的经验排名。下周一结算，前 5 名晋级、第 28 名及以后降级（青铜组不降级），前三名还有宝石奖励。你的数据不会上传。","Leagues are simulated on your device: each Monday you join 29 simulated opponents (not real people) ranked by weekly XP. Results come the next Monday — top 5 move up, 28th and below move down (not in Bronze), and the top 3 earn gems. Nothing is uploaded."],["打字时键盘没有反应？","The keyboard does not respond?","先点一下单词区域让输入框获得焦点；中文输入法下请切换到英文输入。手机上点打字区会弹出键盘，接实体键盘效果更好。","Click the word area first and switch your input method to English. On phones, tap the typing area to open the keyboard; a physical keyboard works best."],["怎么切换美音和英音？没有声音怎么办？","US / UK accent, and no sound?","在「设置 → 发音偏好」切换口音。发音来自有道词典的真人语音（美音 / 英音）；没网或加载不了时，会改用设备自带的语音朗读。没有声音时请检查音量和静音键。","Switch the accent in Settings → Accent. Pronunciation is real-voice audio from the Youdao dictionary (US / UK); when it can’t load, your device’s speech engine reads instead. No sound? Check the volume and mute switch."],["换设备后学习记录还在吗？","Will my progress move to another device?","不会自动同步。学习记录只保存在当前浏览器里，换设备或清除浏览器数据后不会保留。可以在「设置 → 学习数据」导出备份文件，再到新设备导入。","Not automatically. Progress lives only in this browser. Export a backup file in Settings → Learning data and import it on the new device."],["隐私说明：皮果英语会收集我的个人信息吗？","Privacy: does Pipo collect personal data?","不会。皮果英语免费使用，不需要注册或登录，不收集姓名、手机号、邮箱、学校等任何个人信息，也没有服务器数据库。单词进度、经验、连胜、设置和随机昵称只保存在你当前浏览器的本地存储里；网站不使用 Cookie，不接入第三方统计、广告或追踪代码。朗读时，要读的单词或句子会发送给有道词典语音服务以获取真人发音，不包含任何个人信息。网站托管在 Cloudflare，托管方会处理传输网页所必需的技术信息（如 IP 地址），我们不会用它识别你。排行榜里的对手是模拟的，你的昵称不会发给任何人。","No. Pipo is free with no sign-up or login, and never asks for your name, phone, email or school; there is no server database. Word progress, XP, streak, settings and your random nickname stay in this browser’s local storage. No cookies, no third-party analytics, ads or trackers. For read-aloud, only the word or sentence being read is sent to the Youdao dictionary voice service; no personal data. The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes technical data needed to deliver pages (such as IP addresses); we don’t use it to identify you. League opponents are simulated and your nickname is never sent anywhere."],["怎么删除我的数据？","How do I delete my data?","在「设置 → 清除学习数据」可以一键删除本机上的全部学习记录；清理浏览器的网站数据也会一并删除。删除前可以先导出一份备份。","Use Settings → Clear learning data, or clear this site’s data in your browser. Export a backup first if you might want it back."],["词库和例句来自哪里？","Where do the words and sentences come from?","词库是按学段和场景整理的通用词汇，不对应任何出版社的教材。单词释义和音标来自开源英汉词典 ECDICT（MIT 许可）；例句来自 Tatoeba（CC BY 2.0 FR 许可）。","Word lists are general vocabulary grouped by level and topic, not tied to any textbook. Definitions and phonetics come from the open-source ECDICT dictionary (MIT licence); example sentences come from Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."]],__TY=[["功能建议","Idea"],["遇到问题","Bug"],["内容纠错","Content error"],["其他","Other"]];var __PRIV=11;if(__hs.hOpen==null&&this.props.q&&this.props.q.sec==="privacy")__open=__PRIV;__v.faqs=__FQ.map(function(f,i){var on=__open===i;return{q:__en?f[1]:f[0],a:__en?f[3]:f[2],on,exp:on?"true":"false",show:!__q||(f[0]+f[1]+f[2]+f[3]).toLowerCase().indexOf(__q)>=0,chev:on?"rotate(90deg)":"none",toggle:function(){__self3.setState({hOpen:on?-1:i})}}}).filter(function(f){return f.show});__v.faqEmpty=__v.faqs.length===0;__v.onQ=function(e){__self3.setState({hq:(e.target.value||"").trim()})};__v.fbTypes=__TY.map(function(t,i){var on=__ty===i;return{t:__en?t[1]:t[0],on:on?"true":"false",pick:function(){__self3.setState({hType:i})},style:"height: 34px; padding: 0 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; "+(on?"background: #FFF0E2; color: #D95A00; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px #FF7A1A":"background: #F5F7FA; color: #55524C")}});__v.fbSent=!!__hs.hSent;__v.fbForm=!__hs.hSent;var __txt=__hs.hText||"",__env=__hs.hEnv!==false;__v.fbText=__txt;__v.onTa=func